{"title":"1995 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5d77a0e0e895088258838ea006604337598b12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: N \\to N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" /> is circular if for every <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> there exists <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/9/be95649d1656ace4f5647d768ab64b307a85bcce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"17\" /> such that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/3/1230098fb871a4281112095eca3993e1d06896b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f^n(p) = f( f( \\cdots \\text{n times} \\cdots f(p))) = p\\]\" width=\"289\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>The function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> has degree of repulsion <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/0/5a05cf0c4071cad4f05c6779ec9cca0493ebbbf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 &lt; k&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />, if for each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/2/dc20f1cc28b2877c571145db9d8606ca7b2e0e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^i(p) \\ne p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"22\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/e/fce8b21687bc49df4b39d27e0481d09a9da93eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=1, 2, \\cdots , \\left\\lfloor k.p \\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\" /> <b>(*)</b>.\n</p><p>Find the greatest degree of repulsion that a circular function can have.\n</p><p><b>Note (*):</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/8713f55c70d37a64172aad91903b3c3c58354372.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\lfloor x \\right\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> indicates the largest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe10.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe10.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017085352\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 96/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2882/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.626      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.626      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26100:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017085352 and revision id 207079. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}